    "de": [
      "Restaurant am See mit lokalen Produkten, die mit Know-how bearbeitet wurden. Terrasse zum See, Barbetrieb und Eiskarte im Sommer."
    ],
    "en": [
      "Restaurant located by the lake offering local products worked with know-how. Terrace open to the lake, bar activity and ice cream menu during the summer."
    ],
